# Python Panels runtime assets: the whole public/ dir is already ignored by
# the ROOT .gitignore (`web/app/public`); committed files under it (like
# public/stlite/panel-host.html and panel-host.js) are force-added
# (`git add -f`), matching the existing tracked public/ files. The vendored
# downloads in public/stlite/{stlite,pyodide}/ + manifest.json must stay
# untracked — they are fetched by scripts/fetch-panel-assets.mjs.
